# AI Chatbot UI/UX Strategy & RAG Planning

The goal is to create a seamless, interactive portfolio where the user converses with an AI on the left panel, and the portfolio dynamically reacts and navigates on the right panel. This transforms a static portfolio into a highly premium, guided "copilot" experience.

